# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
import tests/cadkernel/source_join3/main.dl

set sourceLine to the cad line nurbs from the cad zero vector3 to the cad x axis of degree 2
set otherLine to the cad line nurbs from (source join3 point [-1.0,0.0,0.0]) to (source join3 point [1e-10,0.0,0.0]) of degree 2
set weights to a list containing 2.0
append 0.5 to weights
append 2.0 to weights
set source to the strict cad nurbs curve3 of degree 2 with controls sourceLine's value's controls, knots sourceLine's value's knots and weights weights
clear weights
append 0.3 to weights
append 1.2 to weights
append 0.3 to weights
set other to the strict cad nurbs curve3 of degree 2 with controls otherLine's value's controls, knots otherLine's value's knots and weights weights
free weights
check source join3 (source's valid and other's valid)
set beforeSource to the cad clone of source's value
set beforeOther to the cad clone of other's value
set joined to the cad joined nurbs of source's value and other's value within 1e-9
check source join3 joined's valid
check source join3 (source's value = beforeSource)
check source join3 (other's value = beforeOther)
check source join3 (joined's value's controls != source's value's controls)
check source join3 (joined's value's knots != source's value's knots)
check source join3 (joined's value's weights != source's value's weights)
loop index from 0 to 3:
    set actual to the item at (index + 2) in (joined's value's controls)
    set expectedPoint to the item at index in (source's value's controls)
    check source join3 (((actual's x = expectedPoint's x) and (actual's y = expectedPoint's y)) and (actual's z = expectedPoint's z))
    check source join3 ((the item at (index + 2) in (joined's value's weights)) = (the item at index in (source's value's weights)))
set retained to joined
free cad nurbs joined's value
free cad nurbs source's value
free cad nurbs other's value
check source join3 ((the length of retained's value's controls) = 5)
check source join3 ((the cad distance from (the cad point on retained's value at 1.0) to the cad x axis) < 1e-12)

function source join3 returned result:
    execute:
        set first to the cad line nurbs from the cad zero vector3 to the cad x axis of degree 1
        set second to the cad line nurbs from (source join3 point [2.0,0.0,0.0]) to the cad x axis of degree 1
        return the cad joined nurbs of first's value and second's value within 0.0
set retained to source join3 returned result
check source join3 retained's valid
check source join3 ((the cad distance from (the cad point on retained's value at 1.0) to (source join3 point [2.0,0.0,0.0])) < 1e-12)
set refused to the cad line nurbs from the cad zero vector3 to the cad x axis of degree 27
set copiedRefusal to refused
check source join3 (copiedRefusal's valid = false)
free cad nurbs refused's value
free cad nurbs copiedRefusal's value
print "rational prepend preserves source data and independent managed lifetimes" as a line
